/**
 * Chess Openings Trainer – Single-file React app
 * -------------------------------------------------
 * Features
 * - Category + Opening browser (1.e4, 1.d4, Flank, plus “Other …” groups)
 * - Interactive board with practice mode
 * - Auto-plays opponent moves; you must play the correct replies
 * - Instant feedback (Correct / Wrong) and move-by-move progress
 * - Supports multiple lines per opening (randomized or selectable)
 * - Easily extensible JSON for more openings
 * - Includes “Other 1.e4 e5 Openings → Vienna Game” per your request
 *
 * Notes
 * - This uses chess.js for rules and react-chessboard for the board.
 * - All moves are provided in short SAN (e.g., "e4", "Nc3", "f4").
 * - To add more lines, just extend OPENING_LIBRARY below.
 */

/**
